{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121945","id":4171058556,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74nU18","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121945","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121945.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121945.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121945","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121945/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121945/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121945/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7fe0faf4b946e959db6e6c070126986accea275d","number":121945,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve `Find in Files` support for built-in resources","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9436\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121969\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121970\r\n- Supersedes #75607\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR tries to give search and replace in files decent support for built-in shaders/scripts\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n- Correctly opens `Shader` matches in the shader editor when clicked on\r\n- No longer opens random scripts when clicking on a result from a `tscn` which does not belong to a script that can be opened. Added an error messages for this\r\n- Searches `tscn` files for `Shader`/`GDScript` `sub_resource` when `gd`/`gdshader` is set (even when `tscn` isn't)\r\n- Adds resource ids to matches in open scenes\r\n- Only returns matches in shader/script section in `tscn` files if the scene is open.\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n- Built-in search only works on scripts that have been saved at least once since `Find in Files` currently only searches through files on the disk and checks if they are open in editors\r\n- When searching an open scene only matches for `gd` and `gdshader` can be found\r\n- Moved `_on_find_in_files_result_selected` to `EditorNode` and renamed it to `edit_text_resource` so it can be reused (for example in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112954)\r\n\r\n---\r\n### Scene open\r\n<img width=\"500\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a60af8c3-1f16-48a6-9f17-5281b32f8ced\" />\r\n\r\n### Scene closed\r\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f25d629-f1c7-4e8c-b908-6d2d116f2b0f\" />","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":